# OS
.DS_Store
# ── OpenWolf (knowledge tracked so it reaches the other Mac; runtime state not) ──
# A wholesale `.wolf/` ignore strands anatomy.md and cerebrum.md on one disk.
# wolf-first-edit-gate.sh requires anatomy.md >= 1024B AND cerebrum.md >= 200B
# and exits 0 without them, so on any machine the store never reached the gate
# is silently inert -- the same failure #182/#183 fixed for worktrees.
# Ignore list mirrors bmcis-dev-config and personal/fantasy-football:
# knowledge tracked, runtime state not.
.wolf/daemon.log
.wolf/dashboard-token
.wolf/_scan-state.json
.wolf/cron-state.json
.wolf/token-ledger.json
.wolf/*.bak
.wolf/backups/
.wolf/archive/
.wolf/memory-archive/
.wolf/hooks/_session.json
.wolf/hooks/node_modules/
